  "releaseNotes": "v10.2.0 — Microsoft.Extensions.Logging support (inject ILogger/ILoggerFactory), response-language enforcement (WithResponseLanguage/ResponseLanguage), parallel Operator requests (WithMaxDegreeOfParallelism/MaxDegreeOfParallelism), renamed LogLevel enum to ExecutionLogLevel to avoid clash with Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.LogLevel. Fully backward compatible (legacy ExecuteAsync overloads still work).",
